; Fast 1200mV 0C Model Removal: 'CLOCK_50'                                                                                                                                                                                                                          ;
+-------+-----------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------------+-------------+--------------+------------+------------+
